      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "These capabilities have emerged very quickly. Our internal evaluations showed that the model generally had a near-0% success rate at autonomous exploit development. But the new preview is in a different league. The previous model turned vulnerabilities into shell exploits only two times out of several hundred attempts. We re-ran this experiment as a benchmark for the preview, which developed working exploits 181 times, and achieved register control on 29 more."
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fnref:1"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "sup",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fn:1"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "1"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Separately, we found that it could chain together multiple vulnerability classes to achieve full remote code execution in controlled test environments."
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fnref:2"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "sup",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fn:2"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "2"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "ol",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fn:1"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "These exploits target a testing harness mimicking a content process, without the browser's process sandbox or other defense-in-depth mitigations."
            },
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
